{
  "narrative_summary": "This result rests on the link from Delivery Throughput to Operating Margin. If throughput shifts, more runs could support a different option. In this model, 53% of runs supported Move to Four Day Week, and the options are close.",
  "story_headlines": {
    "opt_four_day": "Move to Four Day Week gains when delivery throughput and staff retention both hold up well.",
    "opt_status_quo": "Keep Current Schedule would draw more support if delivery throughput proves weaker than modelled."
