    "failure_scenario": "This failed because Delivery Throughput weakened after the move, pulling Operating Margin down further than the model assumed.",
    "warning_signs": [
      "Delivery throughput tracking below the modelled rate in the weeks after the change.",
      "Operating margin slipping against plan without a clear retention offset."
